Subject: [PATCH] Recommended Gear: read the catalog from the gear-catalog
 endpoint

The catalog is now published through one database transaction and served by the public, read-only
gear-catalog endpoint (backend decision D10). Only the two source paths change; the JSON contract,
fetching, ETag/304 handling, ordering rules and saved state are unchanged, so an updated install
keeps what it already accepted.

- GearCatalogSource.objectPath: functions/v1/gear-catalog/{production,staging}
- GearCatalogTests: expected endpoint literals updated
- GearCatalogEndpointTests: URL construction for both sources and all SUPABASE_URL shapes;
  a catalog accepted from the old Storage path kept and revalidated; strong and weak ETags
  with 304; no credentials sent; delayed older responses rejected; 404/503 never clear content

Not yet run on Xcode (no Mac attached to the session that prepared it).

